  "status": "draft",
  "description": "Pregnancy and postpartum follow-up: prenatal visits by gestational age (every 4 weeks up to week 28, every 2 weeks up to 36, weekly after), an oral glucose tolerance test between weeks 24 and 28, and a postpartum visit within 6 weeks of a delivery. The episode ends on a delivery or a loss: nothing prenatal is expected after it. Fills only what the doctor's plan did not cover.",
